  "notes": "USAGE:\nTakes を to mark the role being performed: {役|やく}を{演|えん}じる (to play a role). The figurative usage ({役割|やくわり}を{演|えん}じる — to play a role/part in something) is also very common.\n\nRelated to the noun {演技|えんぎ} (acting, performance). An older variant form is {演|えん}ずる.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {役|やく}を{演|えん}じる: to play a role\n- {主役|しゅやく}を{演|えん}じる: to play the lead\n- {役割|やくわり}を{演|えん}じる: to play a part (figurative)\n- {悪役|あくやく}を{演|えん}じる: to play the villain",
